{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Split.</b> One limb larger than its fellow." "<b>And clenched.</b> Its hooves are clenched (Bekhorot 40a)." "<b>You may make it as a freewill-offering.</b> For bedek habayit." "<b>But for a vow.</b> For the altar." "<b>It shall not be accepted.</b> Which hekdesh comes to be accepted? You must say: this is hekdesh of the altar (Temurah 7a)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:46.768458988Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}